sequenceDiagram
    participant CPU as CPU (C++)
    participant SSBO as GPU Buffers (SSBOs)
    participant GPU as GPU Compute
    participant DS as Downstream Systems

    Note over CPU: Frame Start
    CPU->>SSBO: Update WorldState (time, player pos)
    CPU->>SSBO: Update EntityTransforms
    CPU->>SSBO: Update EntityStats

    loop For Each Archetype
        CPU->>GPU: Bind SSBOs + Pipeline
        CPU->>GPU: vkCmdDispatch(ceil(N/256), 1, 1)
        GPU->>SSBO: Read game state (bindings 0-4)
        GPU->>GPU: Evaluate behavior (scoring + steering)
        GPU->>SSBO: Write BehaviorOutput (binding 5)
        GPU->>SSBO: Write DebugOutput (binding 6)
        Note over GPU: Memory barrier
    end

    DS->>SSBO: Read BehaviorOutput
    DS->>DS: Apply movement (move_vector)
    DS->>DS: Apply combat (attack_target)
    DS->>DS: Apply animation (animation_id)
    Note over CPU: Frame End / Present
